                    <div class="resize-handle resize-debug resize-debug-variables" data-resize="debug-variables" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    <div class="debug-section debug-log-section">
                        <strong>Log Output</strong>
                        <pre class="debug-log"><span class="info">[debug]</span> View wird kompiliert
<span class="info">[debug]</span> greeting · app.sic:1
<span class="success">[info]</span> WebSocket verbunden
